  <h2 id="muina" style="font-size:30px;margin-top:50px">{c.muina.heading}</h2>
  <Locator place="Muina" radius={9} note="Seven hundred and eighty-four metres from Mione, across the Degano — Carlo De Franceschi named the two villages in one breath in the 1870s, and they are barely a village apart." />

  <Plates group="carnia" cols={3} />
  <p class="cap" style="margin-top:12px">Seven photographs of the valley — Muina, Mione and Agrons — harvested from Wikimedia Commons in September 2026 and held here under their own licences, with the photographer named above each plate. <strong>None of them is a De Franceschi house</strong>: this archive has not identified one, and would say so if it had. They are here because the page has spent twenty thousand words on ground nobody reading it has seen. The one that matters most is the <strong>Micoli Toscano palace at Mione</strong>, whose family archive holds the 1679 contracts.</p>

  <p class="dek" style="margin-top:8px" set:html={cmd(c.muina.intro)}></p>

  <div class="spine" style="margin-top:20px">
    {c.muina.chain.map(g => (
      <article class="gen documented">
        <div class="rail"><span class="dot"></span></div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="lab">Generation {g.n}</div>
          <h3 style="font-size:24px">{g.who}</h3>
          <p class="cap" style="max-width:64ch" set:html={cmd(g.what)}></p>
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:24px"><Plates ids={["mione-matr-index","mione-matr-1808"]} /></div>

  <div class="one" style="border-left-color:var(--ochre);margin-top:28px">
    <div class="lab">The name in the chain</div>
    <h3>Antonio, son of the late Leonardo</h3>
    <p set:html={cmd(c.muina.leonardo)}></p>
    <p class="cap" style="margin-top:12px"><span class="chip inf">Inferred, and weakly</span> This is a name recurring in a family, not a link between two families. It is set out here because it is the kind of thing that later turns out to matter, and because saying it plainly is better than either suppressing it or overselling it.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="prose" style="margin-top:24px" set:html={cmd(c.muina.witnesses)}></p>

