  <h2 id="paluzza" style="font-size:30px;margin-top:50px">Paluzza, in the Val Bût</h2>
  <Locator place="Paluzza" radius={22} note="Over the shoulder of the mountain from Mione — a different valley, and on this archive's evidence a different household of the name." />
  <p class="dek" style="margin-top:8px">Twenty-five kilometres east of Mione, over the shoulder of the mountain. A De Franceschi family documented from the eighteenth century into the nineteenth.</p>
